      "text": {
        "jp": "とある場所に封印された地下機構……\n遺跡の調査を行いたいのです。\n場所が場所だけに危険が伴いそうですが、\n興味があるのなら、ぜひ助力をお願いします。",
        "official_en": "I have become aware of a hidden underground \nfacility. I would like to investigate these ruins, but \nthere is a considerable degree of risk to life and limb.\nYour assistance in this endeavor is appreciated.",
